#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/models/work_day.py:0
msgid "%(count)s day(s) recomputed, the last %(max)s at most."
msgstr "%(count)s journée(s) recalculée(s), les %(max)s dernières au plus."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/wizard/activate_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"A calendar answer given before this feature was installed counts for the "
"hours the meeting had at the installation."
msgstr ""
"Une réponse d'agenda donnée avant l'installation de cette fonction compte "
"pour les heures qu'avait la rencontre au moment de l'installation."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_work_hours.action_bf_work_day_shared
msgid ""
"A colleague can share their days with you from “My shares”. They can revoke "
"it at any time."
msgstr ""
"Une ou un collègue peut vous partager ses journées depuis « Mes partages », "
"et le révoquer en tout temps."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/models/work_signal.py:0
msgid "A pushed trace lasts at most %s hours."
msgstr "Une trace poussée dure au plus %s heures."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/models/work_signal.py:0
msgid ""
"A pushed trace starts on %(oldest)s UTC at the earliest (earlier days: only "
"if you chose to take them in)."
msgstr ""
"Une trace poussée commence au plus tôt le %(oldest)s UTC (jours d'avant : "
"seulement si vous avez choisi de les reprendre)."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/models/work_share.py:0
msgid "A share cannot be changed: revoke it and share again."
msgstr "Un partage ne se modifie pas : révoquez-le et partagez de nouveau."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/models/work_share.py:0
msgid "A share is revoked, not deleted: it stays as a trace of who saw what."
msgstr ""
"Un partage se révoque, il ne se supprime pas : il reste comme trace de qui a"
" vu quoi."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:bf_work_hours.constraint_bf_work_signal_stop_after_start
msgid "A trace cannot end before it starts."
msgstr "Une trace ne peut pas finir avant de commencer."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/models/work_signal.py:0
msgid "A trace must end after it starts, and not in the future."
msgstr "Une trace doit finir après son début, et pas dans le futur."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_work_hours.field_bf_work_share__active
msgid "Active"
msgstr "Actif"

#. module: bf_work_hours
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_work_hours.action_bf_work_share_mine
msgid ""
"Add a colleague to let them see your days: your hours, what they rest on, "
"the hours you entered in timesheets, and your indicators if you turned them "
"on (first and last trace of the day, meetings, time outside working hours). "
"Never your raw traces. Revoke at any time."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez une ou un collègue pour lui laisser voir vos journées : vos heures, "
"sur quoi elles reposent, les heures saisies dans vos feuilles de temps, et "
"vos indicateurs si vous les avez activés (première et dernière trace de la "
"journée, rencontres, temps hors horaire). Jamais vos traces brutes. "
"Révocable en tout temps."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/wizard/activate_wizard.py:0
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_work_hours.selection__bf_work_activate_wizard__history_span__all
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_work_hours.selection__bf_work_consent__history_span__all
msgid "All the history kept"
msgstr "Tout l'historique conservé"

#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/models/work_consent.py:0
msgid "An activation can be withdrawn once, and never restored."
msgstr "Une activation se retire une fois, et ne se rétablit jamais."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/models/work_consent.py:0
msgid "An activation cannot be changed, only withdrawn."
msgstr "Une activation ne se modifie pas, elle se retire."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/models/work_consent.py:0
msgid "An activation is kept as evidence: withdraw it instead."
msgstr "Une activation est gardée comme preuve : retirez-la plutôt."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_work_hours.view_bf_work_day_form
msgid ""
"An estimate from your traces: time away from the screen is not seen.\n"
"                        Your timesheet remains the record of your hours."
msgstr ""
"Une estimation tirée de vos traces : le temps loin de l'écran n'y est pas.\n"
"                        Votre feuille de temps reste le registre de vos heures."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/static/src/consent/consent_screen.xml:0
msgid "And your days from before?"
msgstr "Et vos jours d'avant ?"

