"Your days from before you turned your hours on will be destroyed. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Vos journées d'avant l'activation de vos heures seront détruites. Continuer "
"?"

#. module: bf_work_hours
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_work_hours.field_res_users__bf_work_history_enabled
