msgstr "Vos indicateurs"

#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/models/work_collector.py:0
msgid "Your own tools"
msgstr "Vos propres outils"

#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/wizard/activate_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"Your own tools reach back no further than the raw traces are kept: "
"%(signal_days)s days."
msgstr ""
"Vos propres outils ne remontent pas plus loin que la conservation des traces"
" brutes : %(signal_days)s jours."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_work_hours/wizard/activate_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"Your reconstructed working time, day by day, with a low and a high bound. "
"Two traces less than %(gap)s minutes apart count as one stretch of work. "
"Time spent away from the screen is not seen: the figure is an estimate, not "
"your timesheet."
msgstr ""
"Votre temps de travail reconstitué, jour par jour, avec une borne basse et "
"une borne haute. Deux traces à moins de %(gap)s minutes d'intervalle "
"comptent comme une seule plage de travail. Le temps passé loin de l'écran "
"n'y est pas : le chiffre est une estimation, pas votre feuille de temps."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_work_hours.view_bf_work_choices_form
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_work_hours.view_users_form_simple_modif_bf_work
msgid ""
"Your traces and your days will be destroyed, and your shares ended. "
"Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Vos traces et vos journées seront détruites, et vos partages prendront fin. "
"Continuer ?"

